{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"thread local and partition local state thread local and partition local state","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md","fileName":"Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Thread-Local and Partition-Local State","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 00:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[.NET Data Parallelism and PLINQ]]","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Data Parallelism and PLINQ","hands-onparallelprogrammingwithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"thread local and partition local state thread local and partition local state","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md","fileName":"Thread-Local and Partition-Local State.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Thread-Local and Partition-Local State","heading":"Thread-Local and Partition-Local State","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Thread-local state gives each participating thread a private value, while partition-local overloads let a parallel operation initialize, update, and finally combine state associated with a work partition. Both reduce repeated contention on one shared accumulator.\n\nThe final merge still needs a correct combining operation, and code should not assume that one logical task always remains on a particular thread. Partition-local state better matches algorithms whose partial results can be reduced independently.","tags":["baby"],"links":[